{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうぶつの森買いましてん月曜日から始めましてん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日やってましてん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いゃ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒されるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにのほほんとするゲームありますかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかとか思いつつやってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く島に行きたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日になったらいけるんよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コ○トブキ村長元気でしたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前まではずっと役場で寝てらっしゃったのにね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/29/7679140/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして最近は制作期間が終わり、いこまはこれでもかってくらい家にこもってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも時々本屋さんに行きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと時々大好きな原宿行きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこま人混み苦手だけど原宿は大好きだからちょくちょく行ってましてん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原宿のファッションは素晴らしいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまは他の人と被らないお洋服を好みます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロックも好きですし、ロリータも好きですし、ゴシックも好きですし、いつか原宿に関わるお仕事がしたいですね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずはおしゃれにならなければなりませんが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっと話がそれてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の誕生日はどこで過ごすのかしら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだわっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/29/7679140/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちとボケてますが、りんご本体を保護する発泡スチロールを頭に乗せてみました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}